 "details": "Lorsch's Christmas market \"Das Blaue Weihnachtswunder\" on the first Advent weekend, on Karolingerplatz at the foot of the UNESCO-listed abbey. Programme: fairy-tale readings and the opening with the mayor on Friday (17:30), a sing-along Advent concert and a Rorate service on Saturday, an open-air church service, pony rides and the Big Band Laudenbach on Sunday.\n\nOpens Friday 16:00, Saturday 14:00, Sunday 12:00 (closing times not given). Free entry. The Allee der Weihnachtsbäume and the gingerbread house stay until 6 January.",
